{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25116","headline":"楚州盐𡏖古墙望 · 长孙佐辅","name":"楚州盐𡏖古墙望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"混沌本冥冥，泄爲洪川流。\n雄哉大造化，万古横中州。\n我从西北来，登高望蓬丘。\n阴晴乍开合，天地相沈浮。\n长风卷繁云，日出扶桑头。\n水净露鲛室，烟销凝蜃楼。\n时来会云翔，道蹇即津游。\n明发促归轸，沧波非宿谋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙佐辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}